{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":12,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"zel-shivertail","holder-quote":"My name is Zel Shivertail. I am a Level 15 [Lieutenant] in command of Geir’s remaining forces, as I believe all higher-ranking officers are now dead","id":"ff04ed75-8132-5335-b05a-731d09602e76"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":14,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"zel-shivertail","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"zel-shivertail","holder-quote":"I am a Level 15 [Lieutenant] in command of Geir’s remaining forces, as I believe all higher-ranking officers are now dead","id":"7465bb27-e6ed-5d79-8db6-f38d4c2bd350"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude – The Antinium Wars (Pt-2)","paragraph":29,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"zel-shivertail","holder-quote":"From a Level 15 [Lieutenant], Shivertail grew to become a Level 39 [General] after his battles, one of the most incredible growths ever recorded in known history","id":"7e7ef5ee-764a-5c3f-859d-c978629d747f"}
