{"chapter-slug":"rw4-45","paragraph":454,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"periss","holder-quote":"She glared at him and Ilvriss recalled that she didn’t like him saying her name, even in private. It was always [Lieutenant], then [Captain], and so on as she rose in rank.","id":"e2e6b73c-1f64-5952-b76a-0e540b635539"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-48","paragraph":121,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"gershal","holder-quote":"The first wave of Goblins smashed into the soldiers around Gershal. He saw a gigantic Hob charging towards him. The [Lieutenant] raised his shield, heart pounding.","id":"16939c61-ff79-564e-9e4c-75d90f77fa9f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-48","paragraph":313,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"reynold","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"magnolia","holder-quote":"“Reynold, you were a [Lieutenant] once. Do you know what they could do?”","id":"708d1d39-8fc3-5eac-9e07-cad8c1955d8e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-47","paragraph":0,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"gershal","holder-quote":"[Lieutenant] Gershal of Vaunt was an unhappy man. He was not an important man, which factored into his present unhappiness. He was a low-level officer from a small city north of Invrisil. He commanded a group of disciplined but fairly low-level [Archers] and [Swordsmen], and he liked to think of himself as a decent soldier, albeit one who hadn’t fought in any wars.","id":"bbfa6476-69f3-5e84-91f9-0aacb537c798"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-47","paragraph":6,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"gershal","holder-quote":"Gershal groused to himself as he walked past a group of officers dicing and drinking wine together. His throat cried out for a taste, but the [Lieutenant] moved past them. Drinking on duty? That wasn’t a custom in his army.","id":"8efadd97-6128-5472-8186-18e520e6ab77"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-47","paragraph":37,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"gershal","holder-quote":"The [Lieutenant] looked around, worried. Salvia shook her head and pointed to a pair of [Knights] in pinkish-red armor who were striding through the camp.","id":"83d2db70-9ebc-55fe-840e-1010a3771e28"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-47","paragraph":158,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"gershal","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"gershal","holder-quote":"“I am [Lieutenant] Gershal of Vaunt! I will fight with you, General Shivertail! We do not run from Goblins! I will protect Invrisil with my men if you will lead us!”","id":"de1ada99-c937-512a-ac32-54fb1a80ee19"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-44 M","paragraph":145,"wording":"[Lieutenant]","event":"named","holder-slug":"reynold","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"reynold","holder-quote":"“I was a [Lieutenant], sir. An officer in charge of a cavalry unit. I have…experience in combat. And in war. I fought twice against Drakes in the Bloodfields.”","id":"1a646d0d-8c31-527a-9a6b-ed52c2171d35"}
